### Create - birinchi profile
POST http://localhost:8080/api/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Begzod",
  "surname": "Axmadov",
  "email": "begzod@mail.com",
  "phone": "+998991876533",
  "password": "Strong555"
}

### Create — ikkinchi profile
POST http://localhost:8080/api/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laylo",
  "surname": "Karimova",
  "email": "laylo@mail.com",
  "phone": "+998935556677",
  "password": "Laylo1234",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "role": "ROLE_USER",
  "visible": true
}

### Get all profiles
GET http://localhost:8080/api/profile

### Get profile by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/profile/get-by/id/2

### 2. Update profile (ADMIN) — role/status/visible ham yangilanadi
### TZ 2 — PUT /api/profile/{id}
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/profile/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sharofiddin",
  "surname": "Makhamadjonov",
  "email": "sharofiddin@mail.com",
  "phone": "+998990198244",
  "password": "Strong123",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "role": "ROLE_MODERATOR",
  "visible": true
}

### 3. Update profile detail (ANY — o'z detallari)

PUT http://localhost:8080/api/profile/1/detail
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alisher",
  "surname": "Valiyev",
  "email": "alisher@mail.com",
  "phone": "+998901234567",
  "password": "Strong123",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "role": "ROLE_USER",
  "visible": true
}

### 4. Profile list (pagination)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/profile/page?page=0&size=5

### 4. Pagination by role
GET http://localhost:8080/api/profile/page/by-role?role=ROLE_USER&page=0&size=10

### 4. Pagination by status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/profile/page/by-status?status=ACTIVE&page=0&size=10

### 5. Delete profile by id (ADMIN)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/profile/2

### Search by name (IgnoreCase)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/profile/search/by-name?name=Ali

### Search by email (unique — bitta natija)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/profile/search/by-email?email=ali@mail.com

### Search by status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/profile/search/by-status?status=ACTIVE

### Search by role
GET http://localhost:8080/api/profile/search/by-role?role=ROLE_USER

### Search by visible
GET http://localhost:8080/api/profile/search/by-visible?visible=true

### Search between dates (createdDate)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/profile/search/between-dates?from=2026-10-01T00:00:00&to=2026-10-31T23:59:59